* generic_cap.lib - generic linear capacitor model with temperature
* coefficients. AUTHORED (not derived from any vendor file). Trivial
* disposable test-fixture model.
*
* USAGE (verified against ngspice 47):
*   .include models/capacitors/generic_cap.lib
*   C1 n1 n2 CGEN C=<value>         ; model name right after nodes,
*                                    then C=value as a named parameter.
*   NOTE: the positional form "C1 n1 n2 <value> CGEN" does NOT work in
*   ngspice 47 - it errors "unknown parameter (cgen)". Unlike the R
*   device, C does not support a bare positional model-name after the
*   value. Confirmed via ngspice's own `devhelp capacitor`.

.model CGEN C (TC1=0 TC2=0 TNOM=27)
